1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,761
Woman: Thanks for your help. The deadline to apply for the marketing position is Friday,

2
00:00:06,761 --> 00:00:12,170
so I need to finish updating my resume. I'm cutting it close.

3
00:00:12,170 --> 00:00:13,538
Man: Tell me about it.

4
00:00:13,538 --> 00:00:15,660
I applied for a job last month

5
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:18,190
and I didn't submit the materials until the last minute.

6
00:00:18,190 --> 00:00:24,100
Woman: Good to know. So I think these sections are fine. Education references.

7
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:27,210
But I'm not sure I've accurately captured my work history.

8
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:30,160
Man: And tip, don't ramble on about your previous jobs.

9
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:32,000
You want to keep things brief

10
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:37,180
since the people in charge of hiring probably won't spend much time reviewing your resume.
